menu "Ryzobee firmware"

config RYZ_LUA_FREETYPE
    bool "Enable the optional Lua FreeType font backend"
    default n
    help
        Include FreeType, seven subset TTF files and dynamic Lua glyph caches.
        Disabled by default: Lua UI uses the same audited static glyph tables
        as the C system UI, including the factory Monitor's existing sizes.
        Native C pages always use static fonts regardless of this option.

config RYZ_BOOT_DIAGNOSTICS
    bool "Run system, display and touch diagnostics before the system menu"
    default n
    help
        Embed and execute the C-owned Lua system self-check and legacy display
        and touch bring-up screens before starting the Ryzobee system menu.
        These resources are not user filesystem autorun scripts. Keep this
        disabled for the product boot flow; enable only for board diagnostics.

endmenu
